This grammar is vendored, not written from scratch.

grammar.js, package.json, LICENSE, test/corpus/*
    Forked from ../tree-sitter-oberon2 (this repo's M1 grammar), which was
    itself forked from https://github.com/viegasfh/tree-sitter-oberon-2 (MIT)
    at commit bb5282d6d191861b0e4f6c6b6d6540e15dbfec14 (2023-01-14) — see
    that directory's own NOTICE for the original provenance.
    Oberon-X is a toy dialect (docs/plan.md M5), not a real-world corpus
    target: BEGIN/DO accepted as synonyms, plus a new UNLESS statement.
    src/ (parser.c, grammar.json, node-types.json, tree_sitter/*) is
    regenerated locally with `tree-sitter generate` and is not committed;
    see .gitignore.

queries/highlights.scm
    Adapted from https://github.com/geekstakulus/tree-sitter-oberon-07 (MIT)
    at commit 162c3432ed2584efa0bca4fd10e5cb4d3195f4a6 (2023-10-05), rewritten
    against this grammar's actual node names (the two grammars share a
    skeleton but diverge in places — see the node type list in node-types.json
    after generating).

Known gaps inherited from the upstream grammar (tracked for M1.2/M1.3, not
fixed here): no type-bound procedure receivers, no WITH/LOOP/EXIT/RETURN-as-
statement, no forward declarations, no empty statements, comments cannot
nest. See ../../docs/insights.md.
